WEBVTT

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:01.433
Check this out,

00:00:01.433 --> 00:00:02.700
a word analogy!

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.400
Petal is to flower,

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.133
as page is to...

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:06.567
what?

00:00:06.567 --> 00:00:06.967
A.

00:00:06.967 --> 00:00:07.400
Story,

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:07.833
B.

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:08.267
Book,

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:08.700
C.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:09.133
Read,

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:09.967
or D.

00:00:09.967 --> 00:00:10.400
Word?

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:11.267
Five seconds!

00:00:16.633 --> 00:00:17.700
TIME'S UP!

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:18.433
It's...

00:00:18.433 --> 00:00:18.767
B,

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:19.067
book!

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:20.933
A petal is part of a

00:00:20.933 --> 00:00:21.233
flower,

00:00:21.233 --> 00:00:23.100
so a page is part of

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:23.700
a book.

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:24.867
Okay,

00:00:24.867 --> 00:00:26.800
a number series!

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:27.467
Twelve,

00:00:27.467 --> 00:00:28.100
nineteen,

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:28.767
twenty-six,

00:00:28.767 --> 00:00:29.400
thirty-three,

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:30.700
and then...

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:32.633
what comes next?

00:00:32.633 --> 00:00:33.267
A.

00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:33.933
Forty-five,

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:34.567
B.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:35.200
Thirty,

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:35.867
C.

00:00:35.867 --> 00:00:36.500
Forty-three,

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:37.800
or D.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:38.433
Forty?

00:00:38.433 --> 00:00:39.733
Five seconds!

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:46.200
TIME'S UP!

00:00:46.633 --> 00:00:47.767
The answer is...

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:48.167
D,

00:00:48.167 --> 00:00:48.533
forty!

00:00:48.533 --> 00:00:50.833
Each number goes up by seven,

00:00:50.833 --> 00:00:53.100
so the next one is thirty-three

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:54.633
plus seven is forty.

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:56.033
Here's one,

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:57.333
a shape puzzle!

00:00:57.333 --> 00:00:59.067
Which shape comes next?

00:00:59.067 --> 00:00:59.500
A.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:00.367
An octagon,

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:00.800
B.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:01.633
A hexagon,

00:01:01.633 --> 00:01:02.067
C.

00:01:02.067 --> 00:01:02.933
A pentagon,

00:01:02.933 --> 00:01:03.800
or D.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:04.667
A triangle?

00:01:04.667 --> 00:01:05.533
Five seconds!

00:01:10.933 --> 00:01:12.000
TIME'S UP!

00:01:12.433 --> 00:01:13.467
The answer is...

00:01:13.467 --> 00:01:13.800
A,

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:14.500
an octagon!

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.533
The number of sides goes up

00:01:16.533 --> 00:01:17.900
by one each step,

00:01:17.900 --> 00:01:20.300
so the next shape is the octagon.

00:01:20.833 --> 00:01:21.200
So,

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.000
are you smart or fart?

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:25.200
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.267
find your rank!

00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:27.100
So,

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:28.333
how did you do?

00:01:28.333 --> 00:01:29.567
Comment your score below,

00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:30.800
and follow for more!
